{"version":1,"content":"<p>走入超市，不少人都會看一件拿一件，擔心買太少又要再跑一次超市，最終變成大包小包的捧回家，食材又因太多吃不完而造成浪費。</p><p>近期網上流行54321採購法，將採購流程化繁為簡，幫助大家更有條例地規劃一周食材。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.670057+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T08:00:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771600+00:00","content_hash":"8b105efa404e4d1adf52196b080bddf2ebb32808b0facf4f61174888036d2c31","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}